71146596128194_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=JB0s_8DU8LMQ7kNvwGCnntr&_nc_oc=AdqweQ0R5P8Q1UGDvj79agovt-mVW1c62A6Qug1HJs7jfrNyqeMYS8Uvts8WfmNoHr4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_cEXwURHllvwRty-pYGt6wnDrDrooX5CwYoo_VvQIRfQ&oe=6A329CB9"}, {"file_name": "1.png", "id": "2116332565928774", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622315_2116332569262107_6472776043868426897_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0p2iRHXGOtoQ7kNvwHZJX7L&_nc_oc=AdqkSnlXw_3bZvjlPnx-94N1dU5GYzp_0RIWVgSWBZHrnlI8sUOcuM0ShALvRrympb0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8zXe7Q1OqI91uMQfCACbMDXzuNMgNOaHSBB05VTwPMig&oe=6A32AF93"}, {"file_name": "4.png", "id": "909457358817429", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623558_909457362150762_5574869297430657880_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Vj0NDK7kZmYQ7kNvwGWGE-9&_nc_oc=AdoLkhywyBelyUmV_XaiybbGw9o5NyX1S18jLMh5tCn2klCH09fo4qeo6LkjHZAZUEo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9Wz84tUqQzStAKKUvs8f_Szf_DaP2RW4stCa-lrJWKPQ&oe=6A32ADDA"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Wild", "keywords": ["social", "free", "hangout", "friends", "chat"], "long_description": "**Explore with friends.**\n\nWild is one big social space. Walk across the map, follow the noise, visit other players, or let your curiosity lead the way.\n\n**Life as a duck.**\n\nCustomize your duck avatar, and express yourself in ways only possible inside VR. Walk, run, or jump around with hand-based movement.\n\n**Welcome to the community.**\n\nWhen you join Wild, you\u2019re joining a new world that is constantly changing. Tune into events, changes to the map, or try out the latest cosmetics.\n", "short_description": "Wild is a social VR hangout world. Explore a shared city, meet friends, and host events."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https: